OL,3,GNEWSACommunist who planned attacks on  
OL,4,Apolice and army jailed                 
OL,6,FA man who planned to set up a militant 
OL,7,Fpro-Palestinian group and launch       
OL,8,Fattacks on the police and British Army 
OL,9,Fhas been jailed for four-and-a-half    
OL,10,Fyears.                                 
OL,12,FSean Grant, from Musselburgh, was      
OL,13,Farrested in August last year after     
OL,14,Fpolice found more than 50 pages of     
OL,15,Fhandwritten documents in his home which
OL,16,Fdetailed plans to attack police and    
OL,17,FBritish Army recruitment centres.      
OL,19,FThe 22-year-old told police he had been
OL,20,Fa member of The Communist Party since  
OL,21,F2022 and had re-joined the youth wing  
OL,22,Fin May 2025.                           
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
