OL,3,GNEWSACommunist who planned attacks on  
OL,4,Apolice and army jailed                 
OL,6,FDuring sentencing at the High Court in 
OL,7,FGlasgow, Judge Lord Arthurson told     
OL,8,FGrant "the potential consequences" of  
OL,9,Fhis plans "could have been             
OL,10,Fcatastrophic."                         
